01:27:10.641 --> 01:27:14.412
In systems theory this is known
as a positive feedback loop.


01:27:14.445 --> 01:27:16.480
Don't let that word, positive,
confuse you


01:27:16.512 --> 01:27:18.682
as there's nothing
positive about it.


01:27:18.716 --> 01:27:21.919
